{% comment %}
  ZAVELYN HAIR CARE — Volume Science & Sebum Adsorption (Bespoke for P03 Root Lift Powder)
{% endcomment %}
<section class="zvhc-volume-science-section" style="padding: 72px 0; background: #FAF7F2; border-top: 1px solid var(--zvhc-t01-border, #EAD7DD); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--zvhc-t01-border, #EAD7DD);">
  <div class="zvhc-container">
    <div style="text-align: center; max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto 48px;">
      <div style="font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--zvhc-t01-accent-rose, #B0476E); letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px;">TEXTURIZING TECHNOLOGY</div>
      <h2 class="zvhc-h2">Micronized Silica Mechanical Lift</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-muted, #5A4651); font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6;">
        Unlike wet aerosol dry shampoos that coat hair with heavy propellants and sticky resins, Zavelyn uses pharmaceutical-grade porous silica silylate that creates structural friction and absorbs excess oils.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 28px;">
      <!-- Comparison Card 1: Traditional Aerosols -->
      <div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #EAD7DD; border-radius: 14px; padding: 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 14px;">
          <span style="font-size: 1.2rem; color: #B02020;">✗</span>
          <span style="font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 800; color: #8A3A4A; text-transform: uppercase;">TRADITIONAL AEROSOL SPRAYS</span>
        </div>
        <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; font-size: 0.9rem; color: #5A4651; line-height: 1.7; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;">
          <li>• Contains chemical propellants (butane, isobutane, propane)</li>
          <li>• Leaves a chalky white film and stiff lacquer residue</li>
          <li>• Traps dirt against scalp pores without reworkability</li>
          <li>• Volume collapses within 2–3 hours as oils break down resins</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Comparison Card 2: Zavelyn Pure Powder -->
      <div style="background: #FDF2F6; border: 2px solid var(--zvhc-t01-accent-rose, #B0476E); border-radius: 14px; padding: 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; position: relative;">
        <span class="zvhc-tier-badge" style="top: -11px; right: 20px;">CLEAN COSMETIC</span>
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 14px;">
          <span style="font-size: 1.2rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-trust-green, #3F8F6B);">✓</span>
          <span style="font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--zvhc-t01-accent-rose, #B0476E); text-transform: uppercase;">ZAVELYN MICRONIZED POWDER</span>
        </div>
        <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; font-size: 0.9rem; color: #2B1B24; line-height: 1.7; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;">
          <li>• 100% propellant-free directional micro-puff dispenser</li>
          <li>• Dissolves into an invisible, velvety matte root grip</li>
          <li>• Selectively adsorbs surface sebum while preserving natural moisture</li>
          <li>• Fully reworkable throughout the day—just massage roots to reactivate</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "ZVHC Volume Science",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
